{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_title", "source_sha256": "86e6df809f8665b246c41a193388ea0cdbc3923048b9fee935925d1644f34b56", "ja": "紬とおでかけ1", "zh": "和紬外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "abe9e9605fd36ea6c5e6990bdadf66a33fccc208bc42bcb4eaf86db89fafef2e", "ja": "紬とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和紬一同出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "84689e5b2799c85cb3135f7c5b08ef97359ef91f60ff66c1001d819950eb5ea4", "ja": "（紬が岡山のフルーツの食レポをすることになった。\n上手くやれるかな……？）", "zh": "（纺要做冈山水果的美食测评。能顺利完成吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1001b23f2c0f1d9f648981ae64a64f4687d4001a42c752eb7345de9e81e2a1ba", "ja": "{$P$}。\n種はあるのですか、ないのですか。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n到底是有籽，还是没籽呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1aa3224b42016e2b1baf814c32e1657d102921756b1812659b4e003169702ed8", "ja": "え、マスカットの話か？\nわからないけど……。", "zh": "诶，是在说马斯卡特葡萄吗？\n我也不知道……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d2a945f346dddcec1621f4287d833273f80f49e4dc7a8c30c83e090e1ad7a46", "ja": "そんな……！　種のあるなしで、食べ方の作法にも\n違いがあるというのに。確認していないなんて……。", "zh": "怎么会这样……！明明根据有没有籽，连食用时的礼仪都有所不同。竟然都没确认……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ccbbef1baf3165815d97c8c3152e4b1ddc744050501b406e242410624a37edb", "ja": "あなたは、バカなのですか？　それとも、私が\n無作法ものだと、岡山の皆さんに笑われてもいいと！？", "zh": "您是笨蛋吗？还是说，您觉得就算被冈山的各位笑话，说我是个不懂礼数的人也没关系！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "19ccf9d67347945f6929d6a06930a4f0926a44b889cec1b16cecc280faa7e0e3", "ja": "わ、わかった！　ちゃんと聞いておくよ！\n……ん？　携帯にメッセージが……。", "zh": "知、知道了！我会好好听着的！\n……嗯？手机上有消息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "04d7999339e1d16d16431d40bc73bc37ed88170d159b66e03b9db8a6cabd10cf", "ja": "……紬、すまない。\nマスカットじゃなくて、桃に変更だそうだ。", "zh": "……紬，不好意思。\n说是换成桃子，不是青提了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cd4096f90c629fedfdfe5933055d9b45488ff22de026cc5e42aede6869be0a92", "ja": "も、桃！？　皮は剥いてあるのですか？\nないのですか……っ！？", "zh": "桃、桃子！？皮有剥好吗？\n还是没剥……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5398b9ded05f4b7923e786f0f6e4b74f59d0543c729b19834555521cb80e072a", "ja": "（質問攻めの後、何とか撮影が始まった。\n真剣に桃を味わう紬の姿……きっと話題になるな！）", "zh": "（被一连串问题轰炸后，拍摄总算开始了。\n紬认真品尝桃子的模样……肯定会成为话题吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
